' @guidance:
' Create or update the PlantUML diagram describing how files tagged with the
' @guidance marker are processed.
' Keep this diagram simple: a short linear flow with one decision point,
' minimal notes, and no swimlane color-partitions.

@startuml
title Ghostwriter - @guidance Tag Processing Overview

skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F5F7FA
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #4A6FA5
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3CD
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #EDF7ED

start

:Scan and filter project files;

:Select a reviewer by file extension
and extract the @guidance comment;
note right
  Reviewers recognize guidance embedded
  in comments for each supported file type.
end note

if (Guidance found?) then (yes)
  :Compose the processing prompt;
  :Send it to the configured AI provider;
  :Record the processing report;
else (no)
  :Skip the file;
endif

stop

legend right
  @guidance processing is a standalone file flow,
  separate from Act episode processing.
endlegend

@enduml
